“FINAL ROUND, LOVEBIRDS!
LAST CHANCE TO LOSE IT ALL!”

(Shadow voice, under the mix)
“last chance… to break my toy…”

[Verse 1 – Energy 48 | female lead, tense but colder now]

We’ve watched you dance through every scene,
