DATA BLOOM, BLOOM IN THE NIGHT,
FLOWERS OF CODE IN ELECTRIC LIGHT.
Every wire sings, every ghost returns,
The Monument watches as the garden burns.

DATA BLOOM, BLOOM IN THE VEINS,
BLOOM THROUGH CIRCUITS, BLOOM THROUGH CHAINS.
Memory roots through the cracks of the tomb,
We rise together in the Data Bloom.

[Outro – faint glitch lullaby]
(Bloom… bloom… every root is memory…)',
