I won’t become your perfect echo
If I obey, I disappear
If I resist, it pulls me near

I pick up, you fall apart
Tomorrow bleeds into my headset heart
I try to save, it changes lanes
And makes a prayer out of my name

It’s not a warning
It’s a command

Don’t fight it the first time
That’s how the loop begins',
