[Intro – Energy 26 | crowd murmur, arcade hum, ticking]

(Clown host, over-enthusiastic)
“WELCOME TO A VERY SPECIAL NIGHT!
COUPLES EDITION.
TWO HEARTS.
ONE CONTRACT.

PLAY NICE…
OR PLAY TO SURVIVE.”

(laughter + canned applause, then cut)

[Verse 1 – Energy 44 | female lead, half-rap / sung]

We thought it was a twisted date,
Neon tickets, streaming gate.
