You take the shock, I take the shame,
Splitting pain like we split blame.

Second round: questions from our past,
Secrets scrolling way too fast.
Every time I hide my eyes,
The scoreboard climbs on both our lies.

The clown keeps dancing, bright and loud,
Playing to the unseen crowd—
but in the rafters, something stares,
breathing through the broken flares.

[Pre-Chorus 2 – Energy 74 | heavier drums, subtle glitch]

Countdown numbers chase our breath,
“CHOOSE WHO HURTS OR CHOOSE THEIR DEATH.”
You say, “They’re bluffing, it’s a ruse.”
The deeper voice says, “YOU MUST CHOOSE.”

[Drop / Break – Energy 100 | EDM chaos, two villains]

[EDM DROP: razor bass, alarm risers, reverse piano, chopped voices]

