Shadow voice: “YOU WILL PAY.”

Me: “Who’s behind you?”
(spotlight flickers, clown glitch-smiles)
Shadow voice, close:
“YOU’LL KNOW MY NAME
WHEN THEY TURN OFF THE CLOWN.”

(lights slam back to main beat)

[Final Chorus – Energy 96 | octave-up, more desperate]

Double or dead—
they make us bet our hearts instead.
Double or dead—
every round rewrites our thread.
Double or dead—
you or me on every ledge.
If we want to leave as one,
we must live on razor edge.

(tag, layered)
Lead: Double…
Boyfriend: Or dead…
Entities (fading): CHOOSE. CHOOSE. CHOOSE.

[Outro – Energy 8 | ticking slows, crowd muffled]

(crowd chant, distant:) “ROUND TWO! ROUND TWO!”

(Shadow voice, barely there)
“THIS IS ONLY
THE OPENING HAND.”

Single coin drop.
