    'body' => '[Intro – vintage crackle, crooner tone]
Electric rain falls hard tonight,
City bleeds in broken light.
808s echo in my chest,
Courier running, can’t find rest.

[Verse 1 – slow rap, eerie synths]
Neon rivers cut my skin,
Every drop a memory’s sin.
Claws in alleys, eyes that gleam,
City turns into a fever dream.
Debt on my back, blood in the street,
Courier’s beat is my heartbeat.
Every note drowns under thunder’s chain,
Still I walk through electric rain.

[Pre-Chorus – glitch whispers]
Rain cuts deep, burns my veins,
City alive with electric chains.

[Chorus – trance surge, cinematic]
Drowning in electric rain,
Every heartbeat feels the same.
Monsters watching, shadows call,
I can’t rise, I can’t fall.
Drowning in electric rain,
Every step I take is pain.
Neon screams — I fade away,
Drowning in electric rain today.

[Verse 2 – rap builds, darker tone]
Kaelith hunts with reptile grin,
Nyra sings, but the song feels thin.
Dr. Vox whispers through broken code,
“The path you walk’s a haunted road.”
Hands are shaking, sax won’t play,
Notes dissolve in the acid spray.
Every corner a deal gone bad,
Every choice I had — I never had.

[Bridge – crooner vocal + orchestral swells]
Rain don’t stop, it owns the night,
Turns the city into blinding white.
Every drop is a cage I feel,
Every wound the rain won’t heal.

[Chorus – extended, rave intensity]
Drowning in electric rain,
Every heartbeat feels the same.
Monsters watching, shadows call,
I can’t rise, I can’t fall.
Drowning in electric rain,
Every step I take is pain.
Neon screams — I fade away,
Drowning in electric rain today.

[Verse 3 – faster rap, rave beat rising]
Pulse is static, veins on fire,
Monsters chase with endless desire.
Lightning cracks in the sky above,
City don’t know mercy or love.
Nyra’s voice — a haunting plea,
But even her song can’t carry me.
Thunder roars — I’m losing ground,
Courier’s beat the only sound.

[jazz solo]

[Final Chorus – cinematic + orchestral climax]
Drowning in electric rain,
No escape from the city’s chain.
Every tear’s a neon flame,
Every drop calls my name.
Drowning in electric rain,
Heartbeat breaking, soul in chains.
Still I play — though nothing remains,
Drowning in the city’s rain.

[Outro – lo-fi crackle fade]
(Electric rain… drowning slow…)
Courier’s beat… still goes.',
