  'memory-burn-chapter-7' => 
  array (
    'status' => 'ready',
    'body' => 'Expanded Lyrics

[Intro – faint static voices]
(Memory corrupted… fragment incomplete… burn… burn…)

[Verse 1 – Kael, weary male vocal]
Smoke in my lungs, fire in my veins,
Every flash of light just repeats the same.
Gun in my hand, but I don’t recall,
Did I burn the world, did I watch it fall?

[Pre-Chorus – building, whispered echo]
(Kael Vox… you pulled the wire… Kael Vox… you lit the fire…)

[Chorus – explosive, screamed & layered]
MEMORY BURN, FIRE IN MY SKIN,
SCARS IGNITE WHAT HIDES WITHIN.
Every shadow screams my name,
Every ghost sets me aflame.

MEMORY BURN, PAST I BETRAYED,
I’M THE ASHES THE RESET MADE.
Truth consumes, and I can’t discern,
What’s a lie, or what I’ve earned.

[Verse 2 – more frantic, rap overlay with male vocal under]
Fragments shatter in the static rain,
Every circuit tattooed with pain.
I see her face, I hear her cry,
But was it love or a alibi?

The Choir repeats like a broken hymn,
Memory drowns, I forget how to swim.
I lit the match or I watched it die,
Every flash is another lie.

[Bridge – glitch voices overlapping]
(Kael Vox… guilty name… Kael Vox… you lit the flame…)
(Do you confess? Do you repent?)
(BURN IT DOWN — RESET — REPENT!)

[Final Chorus – chaotic industrial crash]
MEMORY BURN, FLAMES TAKE HOLD,
EVERY TRUTH IS A LIE RETOLD.
Ashes fall from the neon sky,
Was I the killer, or did I die?

MEMORY BURN, I SCREAM MY NAME,
FRAGMENT LOST INSIDE THE FLAME.
The Monument waits for the final turn,
But tonight I choke on memory burn.

[Outro – faint, childlike voice]
(Do you remember…? Do you… remember…?)',
