SIGNALS OF MADNESS, CIRCUITS IN CHAINS.
Every scar is a broadcast torn,
Every lie is a world reborn.

PHANTOM FREQUENCY, I CAN’T ESCAPE,
EVERY VOICE IS A SHAPELESS SHAPE.
No silence remains, no peace to keep,
The phantom sings me into sleep.

[Outro – Lucienne’s faint voice cutting through static, soft]
(Kael… the fire was yours… the door is yours…)
(I’m waiting for you… inside the Monument…)

