If love is a haunt, I want the proof
Right here, right now, under this roof

Cobblestone rhythm, boots on stone
I feel less lost when I’m alone
A violin bleeds from a side street bar
Like a sad little flare from a dying star
I saw your face in a window glow
Then it vanished fast like a stage show
