And I keep buying both again

Midnight Prague, cold smoke, neon stare
Old bridge heavy like a dare
Rich kid laughing, broke kid cold
Same night spinning, different code
I ain’t a prince, I ain’t a thief
Just a traveler with loud belief
That love can hit like a sudden drop
Then disappear when the music stop

Say Prague
