Are you ready?
Throw the switch.
What’s the cost?
More than this.
What remains?
Who I choose to fix.

Flip the switch, face the trial—time runs wild in the wires.
Flip the switch, hold your breath—dance on the edge of death.
Count to three, count again—fear’s your closest friend.
