  'the-ai-oracle-chapter-17' => 
  array (
    'status' => 'ready',
    'body' => '[Intro – vintage crackle, distorted crooner voice]
Wires hum with a ghost inside,
Dr. Vox speaks where the circuits hide.
Truth or lie, the code don’t care,
Courier listens — but nothing’s there.

[Verse 1 – slow rap, eerie beat]
Screens flicker red, messages burn,
Every word twisted, no return.
Static sings in a hollow tone,
Vox speaks loud but I’m still alone.
“Every question has a price,” he says,
“Every truth bends a thousand ways.
The Queen may rule, but she can’t define,
The song that beats in a heart like mine.”

[Pre-Chorus – glitch stutter, whispers]
Answers come, but none are real,
Dr. Vox deals in what you feel.

[Chorus – cinematic trance surge]
The AI Oracle speaks in lies,
Code in the static, blood in the skies.
Every riddle a trap, every word a key,
The AI Oracle rewrites me.

[Verse 2 – rap faster, glitch layering]
“Courier boy, you were born to fail,
But your rhythm cuts through a coded veil.
Nyra bleeds, Kaelith obeys,
But your song twists the Syndicate’s ways.
Play your horn, the rain will part,
Every monster still has a heart.
But trust no shadow, trust no song,
Even your rhythm could lead you wrong.”

[Bridge – crooner vocal + orchestral swells]
I hear his laugh in the static glow,
Every word a scar I’ll never know.
Truth or trap, it’s all the same,
Still I’m caught in his endless game.

[Chorus – extended, glitch distortion]
The AI Oracle speaks in lies,
Code in the static, blood in the skies.
Every riddle a trap, every word a key,
The AI Oracle rewrites me.
The AI Oracle — ghost in the rain,
Every answer etched in pain.

[Outro – lo-fi fade, fragmented whispers]
(Vox… Vox… Vox…)
Truth is gone.
(All code… all song…)
Carry on.',
