June said now
Ezra said strike
Cal hit steel and the whole bank flashed white
Maris called names like she was pulling the dead through snow
Antoni raised one hand and let all pleading go

Then the spring gave one deep long tone
Like the town itself had been struck in bone
Every window in the valley dimmed at once
Every wire went still
Every breath got blunt

