    'status' => 'ready',
    'body' => 'Tomorrow Hotline.
You are number one.
Please. stay on the line.

No ring.
No voice.
Just light.
Just noise.

Clock moves,
I don’t.
City waits,
I hum.

Waiting music
Waiting, waiting,
Waiting music
Keep you, waiting,
Waiting music
I hear the route inside it.

Hold.
Hold.
Hold.
Choose.

One breath.
Two calls.
Same loop.
Same wall.

I shift the tone,
Somebody lives.
I shift again,
Somebody, slips.

Waiting music
Waiting, waiting,
Waiting music
Keep you, waiting,
Waiting music
My voice is in the static.

Please stay on the line.
Please stay on the line.',
